        "line": 227,
        "text": "theorem coefficient_insert_zero (I : Window) {ε : ℝ} (hε : 0 < ε) (r : ℕ) (hr : 1 ≤ r)\n    (A B : AxisSpace I ε) {x : ℝ} (hx : x ∈ I.interval) :\n    coefficient I (weight ε) (insert I hε r hr A B) 0 x = 0"
